    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 1492 opened 2017 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 12.607m. During 2017 the syndicate recorded a net adverse prior-year outcome (net prior years loss of GBP 1.041m, implying an overall strengthening of prior year reserves) driven principally by large catastrophe and large man-made losses, primarily on the Property portfolio (notably hurricanes and earthquakes) and some adverse development on older large losses. The 2017 underwriting year itself was heavily impacted by September 2017 Atlantic wind events (Irma, Maria and Mexican earthquakes) which materially increased gross claims outstanding and required increased reserving for property catastrophe exposure.",
